{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31576","headline":"九日巴丘杨公台上讌集 · 李羣玉","name":"九日巴丘杨公台上讌集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凄凄霜日上高台，水国秋深客思哀。\n万叠银山寒浪起，一行斜字早鸿来。\n谁家捣练孤城暮，何处题衣远信回？\n江汉路长身不定，菊花三笑旅萍开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}